# Tool Categories

## Wireframe Tools (Branch Specialization)

`wireframe_snapshot` (structural data), `svg_snapshot` (visual overlays). Excel at detecting layout problems.

## Edit Session Management (11 tools)

`begin_edit_session`, `get_edit_session`, `list_edit_sessions`, `set_active_edit_session`, `preview_commit_plan`, `apply_commit_plan`, `commit_edit_session_to_files`, `export_edit_session`, `clear_edit_session`

## Live Insertion & Manipulation

`insert_css`/`insert_css_preview`, `insert_js`/`insert_js_preview`, `manipulate_dom`, `rollback_patch`/`rollback_all`

## Other Categories

Input automation (9), Navigation (6), Performance (5), Network (2), Snapshot (4), Debugging (14), Chatbox (2)

See `docs/tool-reference.md` for complete list.
